# SPO-415 / SPO-417: Wave 1 outreach data is PII and this repo is PUBLIC.
# The roster holds named real creators with their business emails and X handles;
# the ledger records `unsubscribed` / `complained` / `stop_requested` against
# those same named people from the first send onward. Tracking either publishes
# it to every clone and to GitHub code search, and `refs/pull/*` is permanent.
# Real data lives OUTSIDE the repo and is passed via --roster / --ledger.
# Only the fictional *.example.* fixtures are tracked, as the schema of record.
outreach/*.json
outreach/*.jsonl
!outreach/*.example.*
